THIRD-PARTY GAMES NOTICE
=========================

The individual games contained in the /games/ directory are the intellectual
property of their respective original developers and authors. Each game is
subject to its own license terms.

This repository acts as a curator/aggregator of open-source and freely
available browser games. Games have been included in good faith under the
assumption that they are freely distributable for non-commercial use.

If you are the copyright holder of any game included in this repository and
wish it to be removed, please open an issue at:
https://github.com/VadymYem/acgames/issues

We will promptly comply with any valid takedown request.
